==> ant CLI (worker do Managed Agents)
ant version 2.12.1
==> /workspace e ponto de montagem do vault
==> Isolamento: o WSL deixa de enxergar o C: inteiro e de executar .exe do Windows
==> Monta SOMENTE a pasta do vault em /workspace/vault
==> Arquivo de credenciais do worker
==> Script para iniciar o worker

PRONTO. Proximos passos:
  1) Edite ~/.concurso-worker.env com o ID e a key do ambiente (Console > Environments).
  2) No PowerShell do Windows: wsl --shutdown   (aplica o isolamento e a montagem)
  3) Abra o Ubuntu de novo e confira:
       ls /workspace/vault     -> deve listar as notas do seu vault
       ls /mnt/c               -> deve dar erro (C: isolado)
  4) Inicie o worker: ~/iniciar-worker.sh
lazim@DESKTOP-3KLEJID:/mnt/c/WINDOWS/system32$ read -rsp "Environment key: " K; echo
Environment key:
lazim@DESKTOP-3KLEJID:/mnt/c/WINDOWS/system32$ read -rsp "Environment key: " K; echo
Environment key:
lazim@DESKTOP-3KLEJID:/mnt/c/WINDOWS/system32$ cat > ~/.concurso-worker.env <<EOF
> export ANTHROPIC_ENVIRONMENT_ID="env_01CFzSSbz57p5YXKohqsgCFy"
> export ANTHROPIC_ENVIRONMENT_KEY="$K"
> EOF
lazim@DESKTOP-3KLEJID:/mnt/c/WINDOWS/system32$ chmod 600 ~/.concurso-worker.env; unset K
lazim@DESKTOP-3KLEJID:/mnt/c/WINDOWS/system32$
